01:13:28,695 --> 01:13:34,695
Pain & Gain is a 2013 American black comedy crime film directed by Michael
Bay and written by Christopher Markus and Stephen McFeely.

14
01:19:07,826 --> 01:19:13,826
It is based on a 1999 series of Miami New Times articles by Pete Collins about the activities of the Sun Gym gang, a group of
bodybuilding ex-convicts convicted of kidnapping, extortion, torture, and murder in Miami in the mid-1990s.

15
01:24:46,956 --> 01:24:52,956
It stars Mark Wahlberg, Dwayne Johnson, and Anthony Mackie as members of the
gang, with supporting roles played by Tony Shalhoub and Ed Harris.

16
01:30:26,086 --> 01:30:32,086
The title is a play on the fitness adage "no pain, no gain".

17
01:36:05,217 --> 01:36:11,217
Pain & Gain premiered in Miami on April 11, 2013, before
Paramount Pictures released it in theatres on April 26.

18
01:41:44,347 --> 01:41:50,347
The film received mixed reviews; it was praised for its script and performances, but
criticized for its directing, historical inaccuracies, and overreliance on violence.

19
01:47:23,478 --> 01:47:29,478
A commercial success, it grossed $86 million worldwide
against a $26 million production budget.

20
